.TH SDL_GetStorageFileSize 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetStorageFileSize \- Query the size of a file within a storage container.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_storage.h>
.PP
.BI "bool SDL_GetStorageFileSize(SDL_Storage *storage, const char *path, Uint64 *length);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I storage
a storage container to query\[char46]
.TP
.I path
the relative path of the file to query\[char46]
.TP
.I length
a pointer to be filled with the file\(aqs length\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns true if the file could be queried or false on failure; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

